# Refactored Reservation Implementation Plan (Resource & Paging)

This plan refactor the current implementation to:
1.  **Move** API logic to the `Resource` layer (`ReservationResource.java`).
2.  **Implement Paging** following the project standard ([SearchCond](file:///c:/Users/KEVIT/git/local-csms/localcsms/recharging/recharging-domain/src/main/java/kr/co/kevit/localcsms/recharger/entity/shared/RechargingSearchCond.java#16-175) + [count](file:///c:/Users/KEVIT/git/local-csms/localcsms/recharging/recharging-entity/src/main/java/kr/co/kevit/localcsms/recharger/entity/dao/RechargingMapper.java#36-37) + `LIMIT/OFFSET`).
3.  **Align** with [all_naming_conventions.md](file:///c:/Users/KEVIT/git/local-csms/artifact/all_naming_conventions.md).

