#### [NEW] [ReservationSearchCond.java](file:///c:/Users/KEVIT/git/local-csms/localcsms/recharging/recharging-domain/src/main/java/kr/co/kevit/localcsms/recharger/entity/shared/ReservationSearchCond.java)
